    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8270" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέν-δοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unyielding, rigid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνος κλίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.14.5
			</span></i>; <i>not giving way,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.154
			</span></i>, al.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθυμία</span>
				Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.57.3A.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span> Herod.
				Med.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.89
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, διαθλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.66
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eustr.
				<u>in EN</u>
				297.23
			</span></i>.</div>
